internal fun stagedCurriculum9B17Node004759(): InlineContent.Text = InlineContent.Text(text = "The service brake is used to reduce speed and stop; the parking brake helps secure a stationary vehicle. Steering changes the vehicle's direction, but the tyres and road must provide the forces needed to follow that direction. Braking and steering share the available friction: turning the wheel is not proof that the car can follow the intended path. ")
